title: "Proof of Human Intent (PoHI)"

type: software

version: "0.1.0"

abstract: >
  Proof of Human Intent (PoHI) is a privacy-preserving protocol
  for verifying human intent in AI-mediated digital transactions
  using behavioral biometrics and Zero-Knowledge Proofs (zk-SNARKs).

